  "description": "Variation of condition 1 (approved drawings) of planning permission 2021/1065 dated 23 March 2021, as amended, for “Demolition of the existing Frampton Park Community Hall and estate cleaning depot to rear; demolition of disused parking structure on Wooldridge Way; additional works associated with site clearance. Construction of mixed tenure residential dwellings within two new blocks and within the undercroft area of Tradescant House. Landscape and public realm improvements within the site boundary including provision of play space and reorganisation of existing car parking.” The proposed changes include an increase in the number of dwellings from 69 to 72; a change in massing of the Phase 1 ‘Atrium’ building from a part 4 and part 7 storey block to a 6 storey block; changes to the unit and tenure mix in Phase 1, changes to materiality and landscaping.",
